commit 169c4399f1563475cec1a2e5fa0ed744108a6c10
Author: ledger <ledger@example.invalid>
Date:   Mon Nov 23 01:58:39 2026 +0000

    Add a committee tasks board built from the task sheet export
    
    Minutes of 29 Oct-12 Nov ask for: "what's mine this week" (Ines), done
    tasks out of the way (Tomas), names readable on a phone without sideways
    scrolling (Hal), the polytunnel rota visible at the gate (Dot), and tasks
    with no name (water meter, shed gutter) to stop sliding.
    
    boards/tasks groups tasks by person, with unowned tasks first, sorted by
    due date, overdue marked, done ones in a fold, and the rota on top. It
    reads incoming/tasks.csv directly so a new export just needs a rebuild.
    
    kit/board.py gains optional board.json keys for this (undated sections,
    done fold, row sort, date/prefix columns, rota). The events board was
    rebuilt with the new kit and is byte-identical.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

