 boards/<name>/index.html. Rows are grouped into sections by the "section" field and ordered by the earliest date
 in each section; sections whose date has passed go under one fold at the bottom.
+
+Optional board.json keys (used by the tasks board):
+  section.date left out  sections are not dated: the one with an empty field (titled section.empty) comes first,
+                         then the others alphabetically; section names differing only in case are merged
+  done_label             rows whose status is done go under one fold with this title, the rest stay up top
+  sort                   field holding a date to order rows by within each section
+  column "type": "date"  show the field as a date, marked overdue if it has passed and the row isn't done
+  column "prefix"        text put before a non-empty value
+  rota                   {"label", "week", "who", "empty"}: a list at the top of who has each week, from the
+                         current week on ("week" is the date the week starts)
